Description: DANOS retry-agent-address.patch, rebased onto net-snmp 5.9.5.2
 Ported to 5.9: DS ids 18/19 (15-17 are upstream's); the listen loop opens
 and registers inline; register_agent_nsap signals failure with < 0.
Origin: vendor, https://github.com/danos/net-snmp debian/patches

